		"Id": "mechdef_roughneck_RGH-3MC",
		"Name": "Roughneck",
		"Details": "With the Trinity Alliance's development of the Heavy and Light Plasma Rifles, the allied governments of the Alliance began distributing them to their military-industrial complexes. The Magistracy of Canopus ended up with the lion's share of the Light Plasma Rifles and put them on a series of refit designs meant to showcase the new weapon's potental. Among those designs was the Roughneck RGH-3MC. The RGH-3MC is a refit of the popular and powerful RGH-3A. The -3MC simply removes the -3A's two PPCs, replacing the right arm one with a Plasma Rifle and a ton of ammo and repolacing the left arm one with twin Light Plasma Rifles and a ton of ammo. The -3MC proved effective and saw immediate deployment with elite Canopian regiments.",
		"Icon": "uixTxrIcon_roughneck"
	},
